    <p class="eyebrow">Guide · Geothermal heat pumps</p>
    <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl md:text-4xl">Geothermal, Properly Explained</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink-700">
      How ground-source heat pumps actually work, the four loop options (vertical / horizontal / pond / open), real cost math, the 25D federal credit (expired 2025-12-31), brand-by-brand options (WaterFurnace, ClimateMaster, Bosch), drilling reality, and when geothermal pays vs air-source. 12-minute read.
    </p>
